  "translation": "A su o kelen in kɔnɔ, Yawe ye a ye ko: ta ⟨את⟩ i fa ka misi tanba, ani misi filanan min don san wolonwula; i na ⟨את⟩ Baal ka sarakabɔlan min bɛ i fa fɛ, a tigɛ, ani ⟨את⟩ Ashera (Ashera) taamasiyɛn min bɛ o kan, i k'o tigɛ.",
